poll ret=1 revents=0x8 timeout_ms=120
[demo10] poll got event. Real flow should DQEVENT/DQBUF then branch by flags/event type.
[source_change] expected recovery path:
  1) DQEVENT(V4L2_EVENT_SOURCE_CHANGE)
  2) STREAMOFF(CAPTURE)
  3) REQBUFS(CAPTURE,count=0) release old capture buffers
  4) G_FMT or decoder metadata query new resolution
  5) S_FMT(CAPTURE new size/fmt)
  6) REQBUFS+QUERYBUF+MMAP(CAPTURE new buffers)
  7) QBUF all CAPTURE buffers
  8) STREAMON(CAPTURE) and continue DQBUF loop
[eos_drain] expected path:
  1) OUTPUT queue last input submitted
  2) Continue DQBUF CAPTURE until LAST flag or drain condition
  3) Stop after all in-flight frames are returned
  4) STREAMOFF both queues
  5) Unmap buffers and close device
[demo10] NOTE: this demo is a runnable recovery-playbook printer, not a full codec stream implementation.
